# Clandestine Meddler: its second ability needs a *suspected* creature you control to attack (CR 603.2, 508.1m, 701.60a). Bot1's lone Meddler is not suspected (it suspected nothing: Bot1 had no other creature), so
# attacking with it triggers nothing: no surveil to answer and the library is untouched. The scenario with two suspected attackers is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Island
Clandestine Meddler
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clandestine Meddler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
? Bot1.Library.Count = 16
Bot1.Attack(Clandestine Meddler > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 16
